UID:g1OjoVw2NO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Green Room is a b
 rilliantly crafted and wickedly fun horror-thriller starring Patrick Stewa
 rt as a diabolical club owner who squares off against an unsuspecting but 
 resilient young punk band. Introduced by SIFF Cinema Assistant Manager Ton
 y Ochoa.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/green
 -room
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
