DTEND:20251017T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20251017T020000Z
UID:joHTEBHrto
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nSIFF DocFest Thrill to the high-f
 lying story of Joe Jennings\, a pioneer of skydiving cinematography and ga
 sp-inducing aerial stunts\, as he attempts the one stunt that has eluded h
 im throughout his death-defying life.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and
 -events/docfest/space-cowboy
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Runa Simi
DTSTART:20251017T234500Z
DTEND:20251018T013500Z
DTSTAMP:20251017T234500Z
UID:87OLDELMcE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 86 mins (1h26m)\n\nSIFF DocFest A charismatic Peruvi
 an voice actor and his son embark on an extraordinary quest: to dub Disney
 ’s The Lion King into their native language of Quechua\, the most widely
  spoken Indigenous language in South America.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/prog
 rams-and-events/docfest/runa-simi
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Love+War
DTSTART:20251018T020000Z
DTEND:20251018T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20251018T020000Z
UID:IOEXPpMMjI
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 96 mins (1h36m)\n\nSIFF DocFest Oscar® winners Chai
  Vasarhelyi and Jimmy Chin (The Rescue\, DocFest 2021) turn their camera 
 on Pulitzer Prize–winning photographer Lynsey Addario as she documents t
 he war in Ukraine and reflects on her career spent on the front lines.\n\n
 https://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/docfest/lovewar
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Widow Champion
DTSTART:20251018T203000Z
DTEND:20251018T222500Z
DTSTAMP:20251018T203000Z
UID:badKpg4IDu
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nSIFF DocFest Fifteen years after 
 being thrown off her land by her in-laws\, a Kenyan widow transforms herse
 lf into a fierce advocate for women’s land rights in her community\, ral
 lying her fellow widows to reclaim their rightful property.\n\nhttps://www
 .siff.net/programs-and-events/docfest/widow-champion
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:25 Cats From Qatar
DTSTART:20251018T230000Z
DTEND:20251019T005500Z
DTSTAMP:20251018T230000Z
UID:51wKgrm4Ps
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nSIFF DocFest An American flight a
 ttendant embarks on a bold\, four-day mission to rescue abandoned cats fro
 m the streets of Doha for adoption in the USA in this compelling\, heartwa
 rming new film from director Mye Hoang (Cat Daddies\, SIFF 2022). Director
  Mye Hoang scheduled to attend. Join us in advance of the screening to me
 et NEKO Cat Cafe and learn more about their spaces and adoption programs\,
